@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@profileId = 1
@bookId = 1

### Create reading history entry (owner only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/profiles/{{profileId}}/books/{{bookId}}/reading-histories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "comment": "Reached chapter 3, the pacing improved a lot."
}

### Get all reading histories by profile (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/profiles/{{profileId}}/reading-histories
Accept: application/json

### Get reading histories by profile and book (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/profiles/{{profileId}}/books/{{bookId}}/reading-histories
Accept: application/json

### Get reading histories by book (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}/reading-histories
Accept: application/json

### Get latest reading history by book (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}/reading-histories/latest
Accept: application/json
